arcanestorage_stations_help=Install a crafting station here to add every recipe it knows to the Crafting tab. One station per slot. An upgraded station also covers the recipes of the station it replaced, so a Demonic Workstation is a Workstation too. The terminal never uses benches placed nearby, only the ones installed here. Stations that need to be standing somewhere cannot be installed: anything that burns fuel, like the Forge, or works over time, like the Grain Mill.
